[I] FFmpeg version of NVIDIA codec API headers

[T] Header files and pkg-config files (ffnvcodec) that let FFmpeg build the
[T] NVIDIA hardware video encoders and decoders (NVENC, NVDEC/CUVID) without
[T] the full CUDA SDK. Only headers are installed - the actual codecs come
[T] from the installed NVIDIA driver at runtime.

[U] https://github.com/FFmpeg/nv-codec-headers

[A] FFmpeg / NVIDIA
[M] Dennie Mahne <dennie.mahne@gmail.com>

[C] extra/multimedia

[L] MIT

[V] 13.1.15.0

[D] b97198227caa6f00862186d4883f77dab035eca1bcb0b2869a29e83c nv-codec-headers-n13.1.15.0.tar.gz https://github.com/FFmpeg/nv-codec-headers/archive/refs/tags/n13.1.15.0/

# installs the same things as nvidia-vaapi-driver
pkginstalled nvidia-vaapi-driver && runmake=0

var_append makeinstopt ' ' LIBDIR=$root$libdir
